          <h2>Use the secure guest portal for card changes.</h2>
          <p>Payment-card updates should happen through the secure guest-portal link tied to your reservation. For your safety, do not send full card numbers by email, text, or voicemail.</p>
          <p>If you cannot find the guest-portal email, send us the name on the reservation and your stay dates. We can help you reach the correct secure link.</p>
