          <h3>Use the local team for reservation questions.</h3>
          <p>For booking questions, arrival timing, or a current-stay issue, contact Seascape directly. If it is urgent during your stay, use the emergency line included in your check-in instructions.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section" id="policy-details">
